; Oolite for GFOS: starts the game with the drawer's own libraries
; (javascript.library 2.0 and its engine, SDL3.module) in front of LIBS:.
; Its icon (IconX) runs it in the Oolite drawer; from the Shell, CD there
; first, then Execute Oolite-Start.
Assign OoliteDir: ""
Assign LIBS: OoliteDir:Libs ADD
Stack 1048576
; GL draws 960x540 frames; the host stretches them to fill the window or screen.
; SDL reads ENV:, not the Shell's own variables.
SetEnv SDL_OPENGPU_GL_SIZE 960x540
OoliteDir:oolite -nosplash >T:oolite.out
UnSetEnv SDL_OPENGPU_GL_SIZE
Assign LIBS: OoliteDir:Libs REMOVE
Assign OoliteDir:
